{"ref":"character:dommario","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Dommario is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.2.10. Dommario's starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-King_Bible.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:king-bible"}," ",{"t":"King Bible","r":"weapon:king-bible"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["30 January 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["DOMMARIO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-King_Bible.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:king-bible"}," ",{"t":"King Bible","r":"weapon:king-bible"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Earn 5000 coins in a single run."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["-40%"]]},{"label":"Speed","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Duration","cells":[["+40%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock this character by getting over 5,000 ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Pile.png","w":24,"h":24}," Gold Coins in a single run. He is then available to purchase for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Dommario can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"bioparco\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Dommario starts with -40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Bracer.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Projectile Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", and +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Spellbinder.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Weapons that benefit greatly from both Speed and Duration synergize well with Dommario, especially early on. Alongside his starting King Bible, consider weapons such as ",{"i":"Sprite-Runetracer.png","w":17,"h":17,"r":"weapon:runetracer"}," ",{"t":"Runetracer","r":"weapon:runetracer"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-NO_FUTURE.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:no-future"}," ",{"t":"NO FUTURE","r":"weapon:no-future"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Bone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:bone"}," ",{"t":"Bone","r":"weapon:bone"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Mace.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:mace"}," ",{"t":"Mace","r":"weapon:mace"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Stamazza.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:stamazza"}," ",{"t":"Stamazza","r":"weapon:stamazza"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Hydro_Storm.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," ",{"t":"Hydro Storm","r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," which all work well with these benefits."]},{"c":["With enough leveling, the ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_in_the_Dark_Night_(V).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:chaos-in-the-dark-night-v"}," ",{"t":"Chaos in the Dark Night (V)","r":"arcana:chaos-in-the-dark-night-v"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Lost_&_Found_Painting_(XVII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:lost-found-painting-xvii"}," ",{"t":"Lost & Found Painting (XVII)","r":"arcana:lost-found-painting-xvii"}," Arcana's can greatly enhance Dommario's already high base passive bonuses. These in particular can make King Bible devastatingly powerful on its own without the need to evolve into ",{"i":"Sprite-Unholy_Vespers.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:unholy-vespers"}," ",{"t":"Unholy Vespers","r":"weapon:unholy-vespers"},"."]},{"c":["Dommario's low Movement speed is difficult to offset. As a result, any weapons or Arcanas that benefit from Movement Speed such as ",{"i":"Sprite-Vento_Sacro.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vento-sacro"}," ",{"t":"Vento Sacro","r":"weapon:vento-sacro"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Tragic_Princess_(III).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:tragic-princess-iii"}," ",{"t":"Tragic Princess (III)","r":"arcana:tragic-princess-iii"}," are not suitable for him."]},{"c":["If Dommario's low Movement speed is proving to be problematic, consider taking ",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:wings"}," ",{"t":"Wings","r":"passive:wings"}," and/or ",{"i":"Sprite-Sonic_Dash.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sonic-dash"}," ",{"t":"Sonic Dash","r":"weapon:sonic-dash"},", as both can quite easily bring his Movement speed to similar levels as other characters. ",{"i":"Sprite-Edge_of_the_Earth_(VIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:edge-of-the-earth-viii"}," ",{"t":"Edge of the Earth (VIII)","r":"arcana:edge-of-the-earth-viii"}," can be used to instantly set Dommario's Speed to +100%."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Dommario.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Default Dommario sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Dommario_(Legacy).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Legacy Dommario sprite."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Dommario.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of default Dommario."]},{"i":"Animated-Dommario_(Legacy).gif","w":104,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of legacy Dommario."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Dommario_-_OG_trailer.png","w":136,"h":225,"c":["Dommario as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JL-73l_hCMg"}," of Operation Guns."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 7 July 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Default skin added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 30 January 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Dommario's name is the countryside pronunciation of \"Don Mario\", meaning \"Mario the priest\"."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His name is a reference to the main character of the TV drama ",{"t":"Don Matteo","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Matteo"},", a crime-solving priest played by actor Terence Hill (real name Mario Girotti)."]}]}},{"c":["His unlocking spell \"bioparco\" is an Italian word for \"zoo\" which is used as a sweeter substitute of the Italian swear phrase/blasphemy \"Dio porco\", which relates God (Dio) to a pig (porco), in the same way as \"gosh darn it\" functions in English."]}]}],"subs":[{"id":"trivia-in-other-media","title":"In other media","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Dommario makes an appearance in the idle farming simulation game ",{"t":"Rusty's Retirement","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Rusty%27s_Retirement"},", as part of that game's update that includes Vampire Survivors content. He is a reskin of ",{"t":"Pinion","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Pinion"}," in that game."]}]}]}]}]}